# What the public deployment serves: the prototype, and nothing else.
# DECISIONS.md D161.
#
# AN ALLOW-LIST. Everything at the top level is excluded, then the paths the
# app loads at runtime are let back in. A new top-level file or folder is
# therefore private until it is added here on purpose - the same deliberate
# step sw.js's SHELL_ASSETS already asks of any new runtime file.
#
# The runtime set is index.html, manifest.webmanifest, sw.js, src/ and assets/:
# SHELL_ASSETS lists nothing outside them, index.html and the manifest load
# nothing outside them, and src/ has no dynamic import and fetches only
# ./manifest.webmanifest. Kept private as a result: docs/, scripts/,
# reference/ (including the Figma source), .claude/, CLAUDE.md, package.json
# and package-lock.json, pick-cover.cmd.

/*
!/index.html
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/sw.js
!/src
!/assets

# The model tests live beside the model; the app never loads them.
src/**/*.test.js
